description	"Jango Fett [Mandalorian]

The greatest bounty hunter in the galaxy during his day boasting a wide armory and a slew of offensive gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Wrist Flamethrower (Thrower)
-- 20% slower RoF
-- 90x longer reload
- WESTAR-34 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 5% faster velocity
-- 5% more dmg
-- 5% more FP dmg

^6Inventory:
- Binoculars

^8Attributes:
- 15% less KB taken
- 15% less KB given
- 25% slower skill cooldown
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Rocket ^3[CS1*]
- Poison + Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS2*]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS3]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS4*]"
